# The individuals of a sort (tasks.org, aida-referents-individuals,
# decided 2026-10-21).  some_farmer chooses its farmer with !x: it presumes
# that iota has an individual (the sort node exists x:iota, true) and that
# it is a farmer.  some_farmer_owed chooses with ?x: it owes the individual.
lk.
pipeline unfolded.
declare iota : type.
declare farmer : iota -> bool.
argument some_farmer : [!x:iota] (exists x:iota, farmer [x]).
elim [!x].
by default.
dixi.
argument some_farmer_owed : [?x:iota] (exists x:iota, farmer [x]).
elim [?x].
by default.
dixi.
